---
// Features section — quiet grid, two lead cards, no decoration for its own sake
---

<section class="features section" id="features">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Features</span>
      <h2>Everything you need to stay consistent</h2>
      <p>Simple, focused tools designed around one goal: keeping you accountable.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="features-grid">
      <!-- Lead cards -->
      <div class="feature-card feature-lead reveal">
        <div class="feature-icon chip-coral">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
            <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
            <path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path>
            <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Partner &amp; group accountability</h3>
        <p>Pair with one partner or join a group of up to 8. Turn on "All Accountable" — one miss resets everyone. Real social cost, real motivation.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card feature-lead reveal">
        <div class="feature-icon chip-green">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M23 19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4l2-3h6l2 3h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path>
            <circle cx="12" cy="13" r="4"></circle>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Photo proof check-ins</h3>
        <p>Capture proof with an automatic watermark — date, time, streak count. Encrypted before it leaves your device. Or go honor-based. Your choice.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Standard cards -->
      <div class="feature-card reveal">
        <div class="feature-icon chip-coral">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Live activity feed</h3>
        <p>Watch your group check in, in real time. Their momentum fuels yours.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card reveal">
        <div class="feature-icon chip-purple">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle>
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke-dasharray="3 3"></circle>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Micro-commitments</h3>
        <p>Tiny, specific goals like "10 pushups before 9am". Small wins compound fast.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card reveal">
        <div class="feature-icon chip-yellow">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
            <polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Time-boxed goals</h3>
        <p>7, 14, 21, or 30-day sprints. Finite feels achievable. Renew to keep going.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card reveal">
        <div class="feature-icon chip-green">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <polyline points="4 14 8 10 12 13 20 5"></polyline>
            <polyline points="14 5 20 5 20 11"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Streak tracking</h3>
        <p>Build daily streaks. Partners can pause a shared streak when life gets in the way.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card reveal">
        <div class="feature-icon chip-coral">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M18 8A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 7-3 9-3 9h18s-3-2-3-9"></path>
            <path d="M13.73 21a2 2 0 0 1-3.46 0"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Smart nudges</h3>
        <p>Notified when your partner checks in. Reminders match your schedule.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card reveal">
        <div class="feature-icon chip-purple">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Reactions</h3>
        <p>Quick emoji reactions to celebrate completions — no awkward comments needed.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card reveal">
        <div class="feature-icon chip-yellow">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>18 awards</h3>
        <p>Achievements across 5 categories: Streaks, Comebacks, Consistency, Social, Proof.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card reveal">
        <div class="feature-icon chip-coral">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M4 15s1-1 4-1 5 2 8 2 4-1 4-1V3s-1 1-4 1-5-2-8-2-4 1-4 1z"></path>
            <line x1="4" y1="22" x2="4" y2="15"></line>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Comeback tracking</h3>
        <p>Missed days? Track your comebacks and come back stronger after breaks.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card reveal">
        <div class="feature-icon chip-green">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
            <line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21"></line>
            <line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21"></line>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Home screen widgets</h3>
        <p>Check in from your home screen. Small, medium, and large sizes.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Wide XP card -->
      <div class="feature-card feature-wide reveal">
        <div class="feature-wide-text">
          <div class="feature-icon chip-purple">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M20.24 12.24a6 6 0 0 0-8.49-8.49L5 10.5V19h8.5z"></path>
              <line x1="16" y1="8" x2="2" y2="22"></line>
              <line x1="17.5" y1="15" x2="9" y2="15"></line>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>XP &amp; levels</h3>
          <p>Earn experience for every check-in, reaction, and achievement. Your level is a visible record of how far you've come.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="xp-display" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="xp-label">
            <span class="xp-level">LEVEL 07</span>
            <span class="xp-next">2,840 / 3,500 XP</span>
          </div>
          <div class="xp-bar"><div class="xp-fill"></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .features-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-6);
  }

  .feature-card {
    grid-column: span 2;
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-6);
    transition: transform var(--transition-spring), box-shadow var(--transition-spring);
  }

  .feature-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }

  .feature-lead {
    grid-column: span 3;
    padding: var(--space-8);
  }

  .feature-wide {
    grid-column: span 6;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-8);
    align-items: center;
    padding: var(--space-8);
  }

  .feature-icon {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .chip-coral { background: var(--coral-tint); color: var(--coral-text); }
  .chip-green { background: var(--green-tint); color: var(--green-deep); }
  .chip-purple { background: var(--purple-tint); color: var(--purple); }
  .chip-yellow { background: #FFF6D6; color: #A87F00; }

  .feature-card h3 {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .feature-lead h3 {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
  }

  .feature-card p {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .feature-lead p {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
  }

  .xp-display {
    background: var(--paper-warm);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--space-5);
  }

  .xp-label {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .xp-level { color: var(--purple); }
  .xp-next { color: var(--ink-faint); }

  .xp-bar {
    height: 8px;
    background: var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .xp-fill {
    width: 81%;
    height: 100%;
    background: var(--purple);
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .feature-card { grid-column: span 3; }
    .feature-lead { grid-column: span 6; }
    .feature-wide { grid-column: span 6; grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .feature-card,
    .feature-lead { grid-column: span 6; }
  }
</style>
